        "content": "{\"query\": \"北京 热门经典景点 推荐\", \"answer\": \"北京的热门景点包括故宫、颐和园和天坛。长城和胡同也是必去之地。这些景点展示了北京的历史和文化。\", \"results\": [{\"title\": \"北京市10 大景点玩乐 - Tripadvisor\", \"url\": \"https://cn.tripadvisor.com/Attractions-g294212-Activities-Beijing.html\", \"content\": \"北京市的热门景点. 了解推荐的选择方式 ; 1. 慕田峪长城 · (24,515). 古迹 ; 2. 颐和园 · (15,141). 地点与地标 ; 3. 故宫博物院 · (14,292). 专业博物馆 ; 4. 天坛公园 · (12,308).\"}, {\"title\": \"北京市：2026必去景点与热门玩乐– 点评与攻略 - GetYourGuide\", \"url\": \"https://www.getyourguide.com/zh-cn/beijing-l186/ttd\", \"content\": \"Tour the Forbidden City, stroll hutongs, catch the Summer Palace, and hop out to the Great Wall in a day. * Forbidden City Tour(Group/Private)-Tickets Included. Embark on this guided walking tour of Beijing's Forbidden City–group or private tour available. * Beijing: Tiananmen & Forbidden City – Tickets & Options. Explore Beijing Forbidden City freely: private, small group & shared tours with multilingual services. * From Beijing: Mutianyu Great Wall Tours with Options. Discover the Mutianyu Great Wall on this private trip from Beijing in an air-conditioned car and with an English-speaking driver. * Beijing: From Jiankou to Mutianyu Great Wall Hiking Tour. This private guided tour ensures safety, in-depth historical insights, flexible pace and private transport, delivering a peaceful and authentic Great Wall hiking experience from Jiankou to Mutianyu. Explore Beijing's top cultural landmarks on a private tour. Discover Beijing's Lama Temple and Confucius Temple on a private tour. Explore two Beijing UNESCO Sites: the Forbidden City & Mutianyu Great Wall.\"}, {\"title\": \"【北京攻略】去北京必打卡的10大景点和好去处！ - Klook客路博客\", \"url\": \"https://www.klook.com/zh-CN/blog/must-visit-attraction-beijing\", \"content\": \"【北京攻略】去北京必打卡的10大景点和好去处！ · 1. 故宮 · 2. 圆明园 · 3. 北京环球影城 · 4. 恭王府 · 5. 天安门广场 · 6. EPSON teamLab无相艺术空间 · 7. 天坛 · 8. 颐和园.\"}, {\"title\": \"【北京  10大必去景点】北京旅游| 中国自由行| 亚洲旅游| 畅游天下\", \"url\": \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zbb41CAteJY\", \"content\": \"在这里，古老传统与现代时尚相互碰撞，互相融合。 以下便是我为您推荐的北京十大必去景点 ... 攻略 |最強路線地圖｜熱門景點｜宮廷下午茶｜. Re太Channel 退休\"}, {\"title\": \"【#北京15大必打卡景点！  】每一个都经典 - Facebook\", \"url\": \"https://www.facebook.com/travelogcn/videos/%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC15%E5%A4%A7%E5%BF%85%E6%89%93%E5%8D%A1%E6%99%AF%E7%82%B9%E6%AF%8F%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E9%83%BD%E7%BB%8F%E5%85%B8%E9%94%99%E8%BF%87%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E9%83%BD%E5%8F%AF%E6%83%9C/622071790924066\", \"content\": \"✨ 走进古都北京 ，感受千年历史与现代都市的完美融合 🏙️，徜徉在长城的雄伟气势中🗺️，体验胡同里的温暖 烟火气 。Travelog Holidays独家【7D5N京味人文之旅】——\"}]}"
